UID:student-affairs:3b41e55d9328451b47bfc66eb14aea09922026_3:13:54_PM@campu
 sgroups.com@ctsg.tech.cornell.edu
DTSTAMP:20260930T163016Z
DTSTART:20260924T193000Z
DTEND:20260924T200000Z
SUMMARY:Bloomberg Center Art Tour (3:30 PM Start)
DESCRIPTION:There is amazing art throughout Roosevelt Island\, including in
  the Bloomberg Center! Because some of these pieces are located in faculty
 /staff-only spaces\, we’re offering an exclusive tour led by Jane Swanso
 n\, Director\, Government & Community Relations at Cornell Tech\, to explo
 re and learn more about these works.\n\nWe are offering this tour two time
 s\, this one is the 3:30 PM start. \n\nSpace is limited\, and registration
  is required.\n\nAlso\, check out the attachment below from the Roosevelt 
 Island Visual Art Association about more art you can find around Roosevelt
  Island. \n---\nEvent Details: https://cornelltech.campusgroups.com/rsvp?i
 d=2132988
LOCATION:See event page for location
CATEGORIES:School events
URL:https://cornelltech.campusgroups.com/rsvp?id=2132988
END:VEVENT
