SUMMARY:Send a Post Card!
DESCRIPTION:Feeling a little homesick? Experienced something amazing in NYC
 ? Learned something incredible that you want to share? Take a few minutes 
 to write a postcard to a family member or friend!\n\nStudents will have th
 e opportunity to write a postcard to friends and family\, either internati
 onally or domestically. \n\nInternational postcards (with stamps) will be 
 limited to 2 per person. Stamps are limited. Please come early!\n---\nEven
 t Details: https://cornelltech.campusgroups.com/rsvp?id=2133047
LOCATION:See event page for location
CATEGORIES:School events
URL:https://cornelltech.campusgroups.com/rsvp?id=2133047
END:VEVENT
