SUMMARY:Visas After Graduation with Miller Mayer
DESCRIPTION:This presentation for international students provides an overvi
 ew of possible options for working long-term in the U.S. after graduation 
 including becoming a permanent resident (green card holder)\, if you desir
 e. Working with the law firm of Miller Mayer\, we offer the presentation e
 very fall and spring semester. Check out International Services' Visas Aft
 er Graduation page: https://international.globallearning.cornell.edu/maint
 aining-your-status/visas-after-graduation.\n---\nEvent Details: https://co
 rnelltech.campusgroups.com/rsvp?id=2133009
LOCATION:See event page for location
CATEGORIES:School events
URL:https://cornelltech.campusgroups.com/rsvp?id=2133009
END:VEVENT
