SUMMARY:Student Volunteer Day
DESCRIPTION:Take a break from your studies and give back to our amazing Roo
 sevelt Island Community. There will be opportunities for students to garde
 n\, organize\, and support seniors! Click the link to RSVP and view the li
 st of community partners that need your help. Following the event\, we wil
 l gather again to enjoy pizza together!\n---\nEvent Details: https://corne
 lltech.campusgroups.com/rsvp?id=2132997
LOCATION:Tata 141\, 2 W Loop Rd\, New York\, New York 10044\, United States
